	(text "Breakout for the ESP32-C6-DevKitC-1: plugs onto the back of the DevKit on two 1x16 sockets (rows 22.86 mm apart). All parts through-hole."
		(at 30 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "301f8d46-7e74-4444-b868-bf52322957bd")
	)
	(text "Firmware: normal C6 pinout. STEP 18, DIR 19, ENA 20, encoder A 10 / B 11 (Z on 21, not read yet), Nextion TX 22 / RX 23."
		(at 30 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dc4c406b-f23b-4fba-9887-92308a0d7951")
	)
	(text "Servo: U2 drives the opto inputs from 5 V (servo PP+/PD+ to J2 5V, PP-/PD- to J2 STEP/DIR; active low, firmware 'STEP pulses low')."
		(at 30 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cfaa1f5c-bfc5-4e51-abd6-3b7e3e91b48a")
	)
	(text "R5/R6 keep STEP/DIR high (opto off) while the ESP32 boots. ENA (Q1, R1, R2) is optional: open collector to SigIn1, Pn003 = 0; else omit, Pn003 = 1."
		(at 30 37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9b4ef781-951e-44fc-822a-8f646bc42fb4")
	)
	(text "Encoder: open-drain A/B/Z, 220R series + 4k7 pull-up to 3V3 + 220p to GND each, powered from J3 5V. J6: cable shields to GND at this end only. J4: 5 V in via D1. Nextion (J5/J7) takes 5V_IN ahead of D1, so it needs J4 power."
		(at 30 42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "73f808d3-b21d-418f-b0bc-070411b5b182")
	)
	(text "Power flags (ERC)"
		(at 58 166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef1d0794-ae3c-4fac-9b1a-f2b24b4c8628")
	)
